Section MMOK.
Variables (st2 : mstate) (sc cnt size nd xa c : Z) (mt : aptr).
Let G := conc st2 mt.
Hypothesis SC : ltac2:(zQ "30!iqa!is9!isf@2$0@2$1Z?2sc@2$2?2sc+j0").
Hypothesis CNT : ltac2:(zQ "20!is9!iqa@2$1@2$0+1?3cnt@2$0?3cnt+i0").
Hypothesis SZ : ltac2:(zQ "40!iqa!is9!isf!it5@2$0@2$1+h0?4size@2$2?4size@2$3+2+h2").
Hypothesis ND : ltac2:(zQ "40!iqa!is9!isf!it5@2$0@2$1+h0?2nd@2$2?2nd@2$3+2+i8").
Hypothesis NDA : ltac2:(zQ "30!hu2!itc!itf@3$0$1@2$2?2nd+hgg0Z").
Hypothesis XA : ltac2:(zQ "10!isf@2$0Z?2xa").
Hypothesis XA2 : ltac2:(zQ "30!ji4!jid!is9@2$2@2$1?2xa?2nd@1$0?5HCEIL").
Hypothesis MST : ltac2:(zQ "10!jn6@2$0?3st2?2mt").
Hypothesis REC : ltac2:(zQ "40!hu2!js1!jt1!jt9@3$0$2@2$1?3st2?2mt$3").
Hypothesis HC : ltac2:(zQ "40!hu2!itc!ju2!jv4@3$0$1@1$2@1$3?3st2?1c").
